  "notes": "Classic sandy-tan hipped-roof villa (#d7b590 walls). Roof: mocha-brown hip (#a18579 on the clean iso plane; the scene ref reads it much darker ~#635045 at the shadowed eave — critic should judge in scene light), actually two merged hip masses with a slightly offset ridge and a small brown chimney (prop pending). Every regular window has a grey ROLLER-SHUTTER box above and a partially lowered grey shutter (#79746b) — schema gap: no shutters field on openings; modelled as recessed windows with dark #646a6e glass. Floor-1 far right has a light horizontal strip/corner glazing (#d2d4e0). Greige panel front door (#a89a8e) inside a deep tan porch recess. Right-rear single-storey wing carries a roof terrace with a light aluminium bar rail (#afb0b2). Frontage (schema gap: no slat-fence wall type, so wall omitted): a low rendered beige base wall (#c9a88a) topped by a horizontal greige aluminium-slat fence (#a49a8d) to ~1.6m total, with a double slat vehicle gate at left and a slat pedestrian gate with intercom panel; asphalt driveway (#6c6167) runs straight to the road with a light concrete kerb strip. Yard: two low-poly palm trees left of the door and a citrus/orange tree with yellow fruits right of it (tree props pending); background flower meadow with round trees; grass verge with rocks (#7c7a66) and pink/white flowers at both frame edges. Sampled colours from 24x18 grids 2026-07-03."
